<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "speakable": {"@type": "SpeakableSpecification", "cssSelector": [".faq-answer"]},
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What is the cost of building a prefab steel house in Bangladesh?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Prefab steel building costs in Bangladesh range from Tk 900-950 per sqft for industrial sheds and worker accommodation, Tk 1,500 per sqft for tiny or wooden houses, Tk 2,200 per sqft for cottage houses, Tk 2,500-2,750 per sqft for apartment, duplex, simplex, steel house, and concrete building lines, and Tk 3,000 per sqft for container houses. Use the free Get Custom Quote tool at bongshaihousing.com/solutions.html for an instant estimate."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Who is the best pre-engineered steel building company in Bangladesh?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Bongshai Housing Ltd. is a premier pre-engineered steel building (PEB) company headquartered in Uttara, Dhaka, with 20+ years of experience, ISO 9001:2015 certification, 500+ delivered projects, and service coverage across all 64 districts of Bangladesh."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Are steel composite buildings earthquake safe in Bangladesh?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. Bongshai Housing uses Grade 50 high-tensile structural steel frames engineered to BNBC 2020 seismic standards. Steel's high ductility provides superior earthquake resistance — especially important in Chattogram, which is classified as a high seismic risk zone under BNBC 2020."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How fast can a steel building be constructed in Dhaka?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Pre-engineered steel structures complete up to 50% faster than traditional brick-and-concrete masonry. Single-story or duplex steel composite residential structures can be fully erected in 45 to 90 days."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is steel construction cheaper than concrete in Bangladesh?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "For single-story and low-rise homes, steel-composite construction is typically 10-30% less expensive than traditional RCC (reinforced concrete), mainly due to lower labor costs, no formwork, and a significantly shorter build time. Concrete can be competitive for very small, simple structures where cement and aggregate are locally cheap."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What types of prefab steel buildings can I order in Bangladesh?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Bongshai Housing offers 11 building categories: Apartment Building, Duplex Steel Building, Simplex Steel Building, Cottage House, Container House, Steel House, Tiny House, Wooden House, and Concrete Building in the residential range; plus Industrial Steel Sheds and Worker Accommodation for commercial and industrial clients. All categories offer custom sizing."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How does the Bongshai Housing construction process work?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Every project follows 4 stages: (1) Consultation — requirements, budget, and site collected; (2) Design and Planning — custom blueprints by in-house architects; (3) Construction — prefabricated steel components erected on-site with full QC oversight and staged payments; (4) Handover — final inspection, key delivery, and after-sales support."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What areas of Bangladesh does Bongshai Housing serve?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Bongshai Housing serves all 64 districts of Bangladesh across all 8 administrative divisions, with dedicated project teams based in Dhaka, Chattogram, and Cumilla. Projects have been completed in Gazipur, Bogra, Cox's Bazar, Faridpur, Cumilla, Rajendrapur, and many other districts."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is Bongshai Housing a certified company?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. Bongshai Housing holds ISO 9001:2015 Quality Management certification and follows OHSAS 18001 / ISO 45001 occupational health and safety standards. The company operates an in-house material testing laboratory, testing all steel, concrete, and panel components before use on every project."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Can I get bank financing for a Bongshai Housing project?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Yes. Bongshai Housing assists clients with the property documentation and engineering blueprints required for bank home loan approvals in Bangladesh. Typical Bangladesh home loan rates are 9-11% per annum. Use the free EMI calculator at bongshaihousing.com/solutions.html to plan your financing."
      }
    }
  ]
}
</script>
